WEBVTT

00:10:00.149 --> 00:10:04.881
And we keep going,
thanks to inspiration from patients.

00:10:05.532 --> 00:10:09.691
And I believe that if we keep working
on these nanomedicines,

00:10:09.715 --> 00:10:13.537
we will be able to reduce harm
to healthy organs,

00:10:13.561 --> 00:10:15.307
improve quality of life

00:10:15.331 --> 00:10:17.783
and save future patients.

00:10:20.363 --> 00:10:22.593
I like to imagine

00:10:22.617 --> 00:10:27.745
that if these treatments
had been available for Rebecca,

00:10:27.769 --> 00:10:29.761
that call from her

00:10:29.785 --> 00:10:31.423
could have been an invitation